From: Hardened NanoKVM security maintenance
Subject: [PATCH] package/openssh: update to 10.6p1

OpenSSH 10.6 (2026-10-06) disables the LZ77 dictionary coder in transport
compression, bounds inflated payloads, applies the authorized_keys "restrict"
keyword to tunnel forwarding, fixes "none" overrides in Match blocks and the
GSSAPI state reset. The hash is the release notes' base64 SHA256
(qdyVZd/+hkD2TYY80poyvEo9vewFZqf8RMXW7nZ9Xzk=) in hex; it also equals the
upstream Buildroot master pin and Fedora's sources file.

diff --git a/package/openssh/openssh.hash b/package/openssh/openssh.hash
--- a/package/openssh/openssh.hash
+++ b/package/openssh/openssh.hash
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-# From https://www.openssh.com/txt/release-10.5
-sha256  d44d28a839ea9daf969cc69150fde59910b2b39361dad81a3bd6cbd19218db11  openssh-10.5p1.tar.gz
+# From https://www.openssh.com/txt/release-10.6 (base64 encoded)
+sha256  a9dc9565dffe8640f64d863cd29a32bc4a3dbdec0566a7fc44c5d6ee767d5f39  openssh-10.6p1.tar.gz
 # Locally calculated
 sha256  5bb5b160726ef5756e4f32fe95b35249c294962419650f48d05134b486d27ccb  LICENCE
diff --git a/package/openssh/openssh.mk b/package/openssh/openssh.mk
--- a/package/openssh/openssh.mk
+++ b/package/openssh/openssh.mk
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 #
 ################################################################################
 
-OPENSSH_VERSION_MAJOR = 10.5
+OPENSSH_VERSION_MAJOR = 10.6
 OPENSSH_VERSION_MINOR = p1
 OPENSSH_VERSION = $(OPENSSH_VERSION_MAJOR)$(OPENSSH_VERSION_MINOR)
 OPENSSH_CPE_ID_VERSION = $(OPENSSH_VERSION_MAJOR)
